The '''High Wilderness''' is a vast forest that stretches from the [[Forgotten Coast]] to [[Verdantis River]] in western [[Feralas]]. Many creatures can be found in this forest, including but not limited to: [[bear]]s, [[wolf|wolves]], [[wind serpent]]s, [[hippogryph]]s, [[yeti]]s, [[gorilla]]s, [[treant]]s, and [[ogre]]s.}

